                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'm impressed with this game - it's simple fun and gives you a good work out! I don't demo to many people but I can imagine this is great to demo VR as it's quick to learn and entertaining to watch others play.\n\nFeedback:\n\nWhile the music is fine, I feel a more comedic and light hearted theme would be more suitable. Maybe have a few different choices to choose from (visions of Outrun and selecting your tune on the radio before you start spring to mind).\n\nMaybe better audio feedback for headshots would be good - when it gets intense you don't want to be unsure if you one-hit a bird or not.\n\nFor us taller and older folk, bending down all the time to make your snowballs, pick up the fish etc can wear a bit on your back. \n\n\nIt's a polished, simple and fun game, and I recommend it.",
